# THE CLIMB UP THE HALF-BROKEN WALKER (ROADMAP slice 3 step 7, 43_climb), by
# real keys, from the tread to the enclave. The straddling walker is staged five
# world minutes after its foot came down in this world's first tread. He stands
# on the lip of the crater its middle toe made and walks down into it to the foot
# of the cable that hangs from the drum; `use` there has him on it, and the move
# up key takes him up, ledge to ledge, six pitches: the cable to the drum's foot,
# the drum, below the knee, the thigh, near the hip, and the hub's rim. He climbs
# as a climber reads the gait: on each ledge he rests to a full breath and sets
# off only when his leg will stand for the next section (`climb_ready`), and
# between pitches he rides up inside the bone while the eye swings out off the
# leg to the island under the walker, and back. At the rim the panel in the crown is read, and listening to it he
# meets the enclave. The whole of it is some twenty real minutes, and the world
# runs at the climb's set-piece share while he is up (43_climb SET_PIECE), so it
# is under three world hours of the morning it began in. Each ledge is logged as
# N of the pitch's M (`climb`).
#   TOUR_TIMEOUT=2400 tools/tour.sh tours/colossi_climb.tour --seed=1 --place=tread0 --colossus=2@tread0+5 --hour=6 --weather=clear:0 --stats
coast calm
await colossus_tread 30
at climb:lip
walkto at:climb:cable 60 till:climb_cable
await climb_cable 5
wait 2
shot 00-at-the-cable with colossus_tread,climb_cable
tap use
await climbing 3
await climb_patch 10
wait 1
shot 01-on-the-cable with climbing,climb_patch
# The cable, ledge to ledge (eighteen), until its top hands him on to the drum.
climb onto 900
await climb_patch 10
wait 1
shot 01b-on-the-drum with climbing,climb_patch
perf stats begin drum
wait 2
perf stats end drum
# The drum, ledge to ledge, until its top takes him into the bone.
climb rode 600
# Near the middle of the ride, the eye out on the island.
wait 24
perf stats begin
shot 02-riding-up-the-shin with climb_riding
perf stats end ride_shin
until climb_ready 240
shot 03-below-the-knee with climbing,climb_patch
climb rode 600
wait 12
perf stats begin
shot 04-riding-up-the-thigh with climb_riding
perf stats end ride_thigh
until climb_ready 240
shot 05-on-the-thigh with climbing,climb_patch
perf stats begin thigh
wait 2
perf stats end thigh
climb rode 900
until climb_ready 240
shot 06-near-the-hip with climbing,climb_patch
climb rode 600
until climb_ready 240
shot 07-under-the-hubs-rim with climbing,climb_patch
perf stats begin hatch
wait 2
perf stats end hatch
climb at_hub 600
await talking 5
wait 1
shot 08-the-panel-in-the-crown with talking
tap use
await beat:enclave_met 5
wait 1
shot 09-it-counts-him with talking
tap use
await climb:down 10
wait 2
shot 10-back-at-the-rim with climbed
